{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22139","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湛湛尊中酒，有功不自伐。\n不伐人不知，我今代其说。\n良将临大敌，前驱千万卒。\n一箪投河饮，赴死心如一。\n壮士磨匕首，勇愤气咆𠷺\n一酣忘报雠，四体如无骨。\n东海杀孝妇，天旱踰年月。\n一酌酹其魂，通宵雨不歇。\n咸阳秦狱气，冤痛结爲物。\n千岁不肯散，一沃亦销失。\n况兹儿女恨，及彼幽忧疾。\n快饮无不消，如霜得春日。\n方知麴糵灵，万物无与匹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}